### C.jet_bitcoin_build_tapbranch_spec.tb_padblock_words
tb_padblock_words
     : @eq (list BinNums.Z)
         (@List.map Integers.Int.int BinNums.Z Integers.Int.unsigned
            (@List.map (Ty.tySem (Word.Word (S (S (S (S (S O))))))) Integers.Int.int
